('824916cb-ba89-5332-8fcd-9378686f5edc', 'aae53119-5afd-4055-b81b-60e6244772d7', '0d4f60c0-0c46-45a6-886d-ead834200dc8', 'a-level', '29.7', '9702 coursebook 29.7 · Decay graphs and equations', 12, 12, 'A graph of ln N against time for a radioactive sample is', NULL, 1, 'multiple_choice'::answer_type, 'a straight line with a negative gradient', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, 'Taking logs gives ln N = ln N₀ − λt: a straight line of gradient −λ. Mark scheme (1 mark). B1: D (a straight line with a negative gradient).', 1, NULL, NULL),
('f2f024d4-1e44-51ee-a4f0-1c8ba81ec699', 'aae53119-5afd-4055-b81b-60e6244772d7', '0d4f60c0-0c46-45a6-886d-ead834200dc8', 'a-level', '29.7', '9702 coursebook 29.7 · Decay graphs and equations', 13, 13, 'A source has an activity of 1200 Bq at t = 0 and a half-life of 10 s. Calculate its activity at t = 30 s.', NULL, 1, 'numeric'::answer_type, '150', 'Bq', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'Three half-lives: A = 1200 × (1/2)³ = 150 Bq. Mark scheme (2 marks). C1: (½)³. A1: A = 150 Bq.', 2, NULL, NULL),
('b44f456a-4a65-53bc-b8d0-037a25a23bf3', 'aae53119-5afd-4055-b81b-60e6244772d7', '0d4f60c0-0c46-45a6-886d-ead834200dc8', 'a-level', '29.7', '9702 coursebook 29.7 · Decay graphs and equations', 14, 14, 'On a graph of ln A against t, what is the intercept on the ln A axis?', NULL, 1, 'multiple_choice'::answer_type, 'ln A₀', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, 'At t = 0, ln A = ln A₀. Mark scheme (1 mark). B1: B (ln A₀).', 1, NULL, NULL),
('ab3cec4b-ae50-524b-a981-003dff980695', 'aae53119-5afd-4055-b81b-60e6244772d7', '0d4f60c0-0c46-45a6-886d-ead834200dc8', 'a-level', '29.7', '9702 coursebook 29.7 · Decay graphs and equations', 15, 15, 'A graph of ln(A / Bq) against t meets the ln A axis at 7.6. Calculate the initial activity.', NULL, 1, 'numeric'::answer_type, '1998', 'Bq', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'A₀ = e^7.6 = 2000 Bq. Mark scheme (2 marks). C1: A₀ = e^(intercept). A1: A₀ = 2000 Bq.', 2, NULL, NULL),
('fb87b783-07a3-51bf-8bba-61ea2a035141', 'aae53119-5afd-4055-b81b-60e6244772d7', '0d4f60c0-0c46-45a6-886d-ead834200dc8', 'a-level', '29.7', '9702 coursebook 29.7 · Decay graphs and equations', 16, 16, 'Which quantity can be found directly from the gradient of a graph of ln A against t?', NULL, 1, 'multiple_choice'::answer_type, 'The decay constant', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, 'ln A = ln A₀ − λt, so the gradient is −λ and λ follows directly. Mark scheme (1 mark). B1: C (The decay constant).', 1, NULL, NULL),
('5f21566b-79bc-5563-abe6-77ab0d0df61f', 'aae53119-5afd-4055-b81b-60e6244772d7', '0d4f60c0-0c46-45a6-886d-ead834200dc8', 'a-level', '29.7', '9702 coursebook 29.7 · Decay graphs and equations', 17, 17, 'Two points on a straight-line graph of ln A against t are (0 s, 6.0) and (50 s, 4.0). Calculate the decay constant.', NULL, 1, 'numeric'::answer_type, '0.04', 's⁻¹', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'λ = −gradient = (6.0 − 4.0) ÷ 50 = 0.040 s⁻¹. Mark scheme (2 marks). C1: gradient from two points. A1: λ = 0.040 s⁻¹.', 2, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fge6506084-t fge6506084-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fge6506084-t">ln A against time</title><desc id="fge6506084-d">Straight-line graph of ln A against time passing through (0 s, 6.0) and (50 s, 4.0).</desc><line x1="24" y1="34" x2="24" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="68.8" y1="34" x2="68.8" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="113.5" y1="34" x2="113.5" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="158.2" y1="34" x2="158.2" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="203" y1="34" x2="203" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="247.8" y1="34" x2="247.8" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="292.5" y1="34" x2="292.5" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:ro