('04329dcb-93df-5077-9ed7-260a327d74b9', 'aae53119-5afd-4055-b81b-60e6244772d7', '0d4f60c0-0c46-45a6-886d-ead834200dc8', 'a-level', '29.7', '9702 coursebook 29.7 · Decay graphs and equations', 48, 48, 'A count rate of 1000 counts per minute (background negligible) is measured for a source with a decay constant of 0.012 min⁻¹. (a) Write the equation for the count rate C at time t. (b) Calculate the time for C to fall to 250 counts per minute, in minutes.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '115.5', 'min', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) C = 1000e^(−0.012t). (b) t = ln(1000 ÷ 250) ÷ 0.012 = 116 min. Mark scheme (5 marks). B1: equation. M1: take logs. C1: substitution. C1: value. A1: t = 116 min.', 5, NULL, NULL),
('e1528578-1498-564b-86d1-359fc721a974', 'aae53119-5afd-4055-b81b-60e6244772d7', '0d4f60c0-0c46-45a6-886d-ead834200dc8', 'a-level', '29.7', '9702 coursebook 29.7 · Decay graphs and equations', 49, 49, 'A graph of A against t is drawn for a sample. At t = 0, A = 900 Bq and the tangent to the curve has a gradient of −27 Bq s⁻¹. (a) Explain why dA/dt = −λA. (b) Calculate λ. (c) Calculate the half-life. Give only the answer to (c).', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '23.1', 's', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) A = λN, so dA/dt = λ dN/dt = −λ²N = −λA. (b) λ = 27 ÷ 900 = 0.030 s⁻¹. (c) t½ = 0.693 ÷ 0.030 = 23.1 s. Mark scheme (6 marks). B1: derivation. M1: λ = −(dA/dt)/A. C1: λ. M1: t½ = ln 2/λ. C1: value. A1: t½ = 23.1 s.', 6, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg2d849023-t fg2d849023-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg2d849023-t">Tangent at t = 0</title><desc id="fg2d849023-d">Graph of activity against time starting at 900 Bq, with the tangent at t = 0 drawn dashed; its gradient is −27 Bq s⁻¹.</desc><line x1="36.2" y1="34" x2="36.2" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="105.3" y1="34" x2="105.3" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="174.5" y1="34" x2="174.5" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="243.7" y1="34" x2="243.7" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="312.8" y1="34" x2="312.8" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="382" y1="34" x2="382" y2="242" style="